/target
**/*.rs.bk
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store

# Next.js client
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/.env*.local

# Browser-automation scratch: console logs, page snapshots and screenshots dropped by the
# Playwright/Chrome MCP servers while driving the desktop client. Evidence worth keeping is
# copied into docs/verification/ deliberately; this directory is the raw spill.
.playwright-mcp/

# A session's own handoff notes: the queue, what is half-done, and decisions that live in no
# commit. IGNORED RATHER THAN COMMITTED, on purpose — it is a scratchpad, and a committed one
# becomes paperwork that outlives its accuracy. It carries only what git cannot already tell you,
# so it is rebuildable from `git log` and `docs/` in ten minutes if it is ever lost.
#
# The rule is committed; the contents are not. This repo is public: the ignore is what stops a
# careless `git add -A` putting internal session state in front of everybody.
.handoff/
